{%- comment -%}
GUIDELINES FOR AI ASSISTANT — VIKUNJA TASKS PLUGIN
=====================================================

ARCHITECTURE PREFERENCES:
- Framework: v3.x (full color support available but prefer grayscale for clarity)
- Target 4 layout variations: full, half_horizontal, half_vertical, quadrant
- Big screens (TRMNL X): use responsive sizing (lg: prefixes) to scale up
- Keep all common code here — title_bar, shared CSS, data prep
- Individual views should only contain layout-specific markup
- Comment liberally — explain WHY, not just WHAT
- Keep code readable over clever

DATA STRUCTURE (from Vikunja API):
- `data` is an array of task objects
- Key fields: id, title, description, done (boolean), percent_done (0-1 decimal)
- Dates: due_date, start_date, end_date (all ISO strings, check for "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z")
- Relations: assignees (array), labels (null or array), project_id
- Display: hex_color (string), priority (number), position (number)

DATA PRIORITIES:
- Tasks sorted: most recent first (API returns in this order)
- percent_done: multiply by 100 for display (0.5 = 50%)
- due_date: only display if not "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z" (Vikunja's "no date" value)
- assignees: show first assignee name if present

DISPLAY PATTERNS:
- Progress: prefer text percentage over progress bars (cleaner on e-ink)
- Dates: use relative when recent ("Today", "Tomorrow") if possible, else short date
- Task title: clamp to 1-2 lines depending on view size
- Index numbers: use `forloop.index` in meta section of item component

CUSTOM PATTERNS IN USE:
- Due date validation: `{% unless task.due_date == "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z" %}`
- Progress calc: `{{ task.percent_done | times: 100 | round: 0 }}%`
- Assignee display: `{{ task.assignees[0].name | default: "Unassigned" }}`

VIEW-SPECIFIC NOTES:
- full: show 6-8 tasks with descriptions
- half_horizontal: 3-4 tasks max, side-by-side layout preferred
- half_vertical: 4-6 tasks, stacked vertically
- quadrant: 2-3 tasks max, minimal details (title + percent only)

COLOR POLICY:
- Default to grayscale for maximum device compatibility
- hex_color field available but rarely set — don't rely on it
- If using color: prefer semantic labels (label--success for done, etc.)
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}
  ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  DATA PREPARATION — FILTER PIPELINE
  ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  
  Filter order: cheapest comparisons first → most expensive last.
  
  Filters applied:
    1. Status         (done boolean)
    2. Favorites      (is_favorite boolean)
    3. Priority       (numeric threshold)
    4. Min progress   (percent_done × 100)
    5. Due within     (date range, excludes sentinel)
    6. Project IDs    (comma-separated membership)
    7. Assignee names (nested array, comma-separated)
    8. Search         (comma-separated OR on title+description)
  ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign filtered_tasks = data | where_exp: "t", "t.done == false" -%}
{%- if status_filter == "completed" -%}
  {%- assign filtered_tasks = data | where_exp: "t", "t.done == true" -%}
{%- elsif status_filter == "all" -%}
  {%- assign filtered_tasks = data -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- if show_favorites_only -%}
  {%- assign filtered_tasks = filtered_tasks | where: "is_favorite", true -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- assign min_priority = priority_filter | plus: 0 -%}
{%- if min_priority > 0 -%}
  {%- assign filtered_tasks = filtered_tasks | where_exp: "t", "t.priority >= min_priority" -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- assign min_pct = min_progress | plus: 0 -%}
{%- if min_pct > 0 -%}
  {%- assign filtered_tasks = filtered_tasks | where_exp: "t", "t.percent_done | times: 100 >= min_pct" -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- assign due_days = due_within_days | plus: 0 -%}
{%- if due_days > 0 -%}
  {%- assign now_s = "now" | date: "%s" | plus: 0 -%}
  {%- assign cutoff_s = now_s | plus: due_days | times: 86400 -%}
  {%- assign due_matched = "" | split: "" -%}
  {%- for task in filtered_tasks -%}
    {%- if task.due_date != "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z" and task.due_date != nil -%}
      {%- assign due_s = task.due_date | date: "%s" | plus: 0 -%}
      {%- if due_s >= now_s and due_s <= cutoff_s -%}
        {%- assign due_matched = due_matched | push: task -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign filtered_tasks = due_matched -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- if project_ids != "" and project_ids != nil -%}
  {%- assign pid_list = project_ids | split: "," -%}
  {%- assign proj_matched = "" | split: "" -%}
  {%- for task in filtered_tasks -%}
    {%- assign tid = task.project_id | append: "" -%}
    {%- for pid in pid_list -%}
      {%- assign pid_trim = pid | strip -%}
      {%- if tid == pid_trim -%}
        {%- assign proj_matched = proj_matched | push: task -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign filtered_tasks = proj_matched -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- if assignee_names != "" and assignee_names != nil -%}
  {%- assign name_list = assignee_names | split: "," -%}
  {%- assign assignee_matched = "" | split: "" -%}
  {%- for task in filtered_tasks -%}
    {%- if task.assignees != null and task.assignees.size > 0 -%}
      {%- assign is_assignee_match = false -%}
      {%- for assignee in task.assignees -%}
        {%- for name in name_list -%}
          {%- assign clean_name = name | strip | downcase -%}
          {%- assign a_name = assignee.name | downcase -%}
          {%- assign a_user = assignee.username | downcase -%}
          {%- if a_name == clean_name or a_user == clean_name -%}
            {%- assign is_assignee_match = true -%}
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
      {%- if is_assignee_match -%}
        {%- assign assignee_matched = assignee_matched | push: task -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign filtered_tasks = assignee_matched -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- if search_query != "" and search_query != nil -%}
  {%- assign kw_list = search_query | split: "," -%}
  {%- assign search_matched = "" | split: "" -%}
  {%- for task in filtered_tasks -%}
    {%- assign is_search_match = false -%}
    {%- assign t_title = task.title | downcase -%}
    {%- assign t_desc = task.description | downcase -%}
    {%- for kw in kw_list -%}
      {%- assign clean_kw = kw | strip | downcase -%}
      {%- if t_title contains clean_kw or t_desc contains clean_kw -%}
        {%- assign is_search_match = true -%}
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
    {%- if is_search_match -%}
      {%- assign search_matched = search_matched | push: task -%}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- assign filtered_tasks = search_matched -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- assign tpv = tasks_per_view | plus: 0 -%}
{%- if tpv < 1 -%}{%- assign tpv = 6 -%}{%- endif -%}
{%- assign filtered_tasks = filtered_tasks | slice: 0, tpv -%}

{%- capture title_bar -%}
<div class="title_bar">
    <img class="image image-stroke" src="https://trmnl.com/images/plugins/trmnl--render.svg">
    <span class="title">Vikunja</span>
    <span class="instance">{{ filtered_tasks | size }} open</span>
</div>
{%- endcapture -%}
